 "notes": [
  "The card list stops at the Interrupts (45 cards). The strategy opens 'I've forgotten to add my effects and weapons to the list' and then lists 13 Effects and '2x Vader's Saber'; those 15 cards are added from the strategy text, giving 60.",
  "Section headers ('Agents', 'Freaks', 'Hot Spots', 'Blue Stuff', 'Interrupts') are not cards.",
  "Posted 'IG-88 w/ gun' dested IG-88 With Riot Gun; 'Colonel Wulf Yularen' Colonel Wullf Yularen; 'Sergeant Torrent' Sergeant Torent; '2xDreadnaught' Dreadnaught-Class Heavy Cruiser; 'Dengar In P1' / 'Zuckuss In MH' / 'Boba in S1' / 'Bossk In HT' the pilot-in-ship cards; 'Imperial Square' Coruscant: Imperial Square.",
  "'Hot Spots' docking bays dested: SpacePort DB Spaceport Docking Bay, Endor DB Endor: Landing Platform (Docking Bay), Hoth DB Hoth: Echo Docking Bay, Y4 DB Yavin 4: Docking Bay, DS2 DB Death Star II: Docking Bay, Coruscant DB Coruscant: Docking Bay. The strategy says 'I took out Coruscant', but Coruscant DB and Imperial Square are still in the list; dested as posted.",
  "Secret Plans, Oppressive Enforcement and Come Here You Big Coward are Effects in 2000 (not the later Defensive Shields)."
 ]
